      "worked_solution": "The general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x & =-\\frac{\\pi }{3}+n\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the above equation for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x & =-\\frac{\\pi }{3}+n\\pi  \\\\ x & =-\\frac{\\pi }{9}+\\frac{n\\pi }{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that $a=-\\frac{1}{9}.$",
