      "knowledge_point": "Finding the General Solution to an Equation Containing a Transformed Tangent or Cotangent Function",
      "problem": "Find the general solution of the following trigonometric equation:\n\n$$\n\\tan\\left(2x - \\dfrac{\\pi}{4} \\right) =  -1\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "The general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-\\frac{\\pi }{4} & =-\\frac{\\pi }{4}+n\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the above equation for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & =n\\pi  \\\\ x & =\\frac{n\\pi }{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
